Third-party assets
==================

Settings navigation glyph
-------------------------

- Source: SVG Repo — https://www.svgrepo.com
  Downloaded as `copy-svgrepo-com.svg`; the file header records it as uploaded to
  SVG Repo and transformed by SVG Repo Mixer Tools.
- License: SVG Repo's default licence, which permits using the material as part
  of a project (including commercial projects) and remixing it, asks for — but
  does not require — an "Icons by svgrepo.com" credit, and forbids redistributing
  the material on its own or reselling it as-is.
  Terms: https://www.svgrepo.com/page/licensing/
- Individual icon pages can state a different licence and take precedence. The
  downloaded file carries no icon-page URL, so the exact collection could not be
  resolved; this notice is the conservative attribution for that case.
- Modification: the path data is embedded as an alpha mask in the client bundle
  (`lib/client-body.js`, `NAV_GLYPH_SVG`), its viewBox is cropped to the artwork
  bounds, and its fill colour is replaced with `currentColor` at render time.

Everything else in this package was written for this project and is covered by
